; WarbandVR d3d9.dll proxy - module definition file
; We must export every d3d9.dll symbol that mb_warband.exe (or its
; dependencies, e.g. d3dx9_xx.dll) might import. The ones we care about
; are implemented in dllmain.cpp; the rest are thin forwarders that are
; resolved at runtime against the real system d3d9.dll.
;
; If the game ever fails to load with "missing export", add the missing
; name here and a matching forward stub in dllmain.cpp.

EXPORTS
    Direct3DCreate9
    Direct3DCreate9Ex
    Direct3DShaderValidatorCreate9
    D3DPERF_BeginEvent
    D3DPERF_EndEvent
    D3DPERF_SetMarker
    D3DPERF_SetRegion
    D3DPERF_QueryRepeatFrame
    D3DPERF_SetOptions
    D3DPERF_GetStatus
    DebugSetMute
    DebugSetLevel
